{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kaho.walk",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "收工路上遇到一只小狗",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kaho.walk",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kaho.walk",
    "idolId": "kaho",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……辛苦了，果穗。今天状态相当好啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿。总觉得，特别集中！",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，很努力。托你的福拍摄也提前收工了……先回一次事务所吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "工作忙起来了吧。和学校两边兼顾，不辛苦吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "不会！超——开心的！",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "偶像的工作也好，学校的学习也好，对我来说都是重要的……",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "英雄的话，两边都必须努力！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，是吗。嗯，别太勉强啊。难受了要马上说。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！现在精神满满……那时候我会好好说的！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。跟我说也行，跟家里人说也行。别一个人憋着。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话说回来，最近和父母聊工作的事吗？还是一样支持你吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！爸爸和妈妈，我的工作变多，他们就很高兴！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "上次，妈妈她——啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……？……哦，是小狗啊。这一带遛狗的人挺多。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "小小的尾巴摇啊摇的——超——可爱！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，是啊。果穗喜欢狗吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！我家也有一只超可爱的マメ丸！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "マメ丸……？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "啊，那个……マメ丸是我家养的柴犬。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "真的真的很可爱！很有精神，又亲人……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "我和マメ丸，从小就一直在一起！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。那已经是兄弟一样了吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！……要是能和制作人先生一起遛マメ丸，一定很开心！",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "制作人先生的话，马上就能和マメ丸成为好朋友！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，那我会很高兴。我也期待见到它。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！因为マメ丸真的是个好孩子！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……マメ丸和果穗，说不定很像。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "诶？为什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "果穗也精神满满，又亲人，不是吗？我说的是这一点像。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "……啊，不过……确实可能很像！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "哇！我都没注意到！这样啊，我和マメ丸有一样的地方！",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿！不愧是制作人先生！比我自己还了解我！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，这也不值得那么夸……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "下次，也许可以试着和マメ丸一起拍照。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "我和マメ丸……？哇，制作人先生，那超——开心的！",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。到时候给我看最好的合照。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！和マメ丸、和制作人先生一起的话……我无论什么时候都会笑出来！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-11-02T02:10:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T02:10:00.000Z",
